{
    "format": 1,
    "_comment": [
        "Press Tower: a printworks King of the Hill, mirrored about X 1800; design and validation: docs/polish-press-tower.md.",
        "Required route: drop from home and walk up ramp_a, across the raised press bed and down ramp_b. Every higher route is optional.",
        "The press head is the summit: from it a holder sees both home roofs and gantries but no floor, bed, frame or spawn body.",
        "Optional climbs are the stair (four 80-unit taps or held jumps) and the hoist (bed to frame to shoulder, two held jumps, then a tap).",
        "Ramps support players but pass paint. Rulers are one-way supports, solid to projectiles; press_base is covered and never scores.",
        "Interior dressing only: works wall, skylights, roof truss and hanging signs; no sun, clouds or hills.",
        "Explicit-only, excluded from Random until attended arena acceptance. King of the Hill's original file is kept unchanged beside it.",
        "Reuses accepted King of the Hill audio and icon; this does not create a new cue or claim listening acceptance."
    ],
